          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Let $x,y$ be integer numbers. Choose the propositional function $P(x,y)$ such that<br/>$$\\forall x \\exists y\\, P(x,y) = F \\quad \\text{and} \\quad \\exists x \\exists y\\, P(x,y) = T.$$<br/>(i) $P(x,y) = $ &quot;$x^2+y^2=5$&quot;<br/>(ii) $P(x,y) = $ &quot;$x^2+y=5$&quot;<br/>(iii) $P(x,y) = $ &quot;$x^2+y^2=-5$&quot;<br/>(iv) $P(x,y) = $ &quot;$x^2+y=-5$&quot;</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Cho $x,y$ là các số nguyên. Chọn hàm mệnh đề $P(x,y)$ sao cho<br/>$$\\forall x \\exists y\\, P(x,y) = F \\quad \\text{và} \\quad \\exists x \\exists y\\, P(x,y) = T.$$<br/>(i) $P(x,y) = $ &quot;$x^2+y^2=5$&quot;<br/>(ii) $P(x,y) = $ &quot;$x^2+y=5$&quot;<br/>(iii) $P(x,y) = $ &quot;$x^2+y^2=-5$&quot;<br/>(iv) $P(x,y) = $ &quot;$x^2+y=-5$&quot;</p></div>",
